+Session attachment modes are enforced across connections. Legacy `attach` requests without a mode are shared; shared attachments may coexist, while `mode: "exclusive"` requires no existing attachment and blocks every later attachment until detach or disconnect. Session creation grants the creating connection an exclusive attachment.
+
+The server dispatches `steer` and `follow_up` separately: services interrupt the active turn for the former and queue the latter for the next boundary.
 This package does not provide a standalone CLI or coding-agent service. Applications supply the `PiServerService` implementation.
 
